To,
The Nodal Officer / Fraud Control & Operations
{{receiver_name}} (Bank / Payment Gateway / Exchange)

STATUTORY ORDER TO FREEZE SUSPECT FINANCIAL ACCOUNT / BENEFICIARY

WHEREAS cyber fraud proceeds in FIR No. {{case_number}} have been traced to the following beneficiary account maintained with your institution:

Account / Wallet No: {{account_number}}
Account Holder Name: {{account_holder}}
IFSC / Gateway Ref: {{ifsc_or_ref}}
Disputed Fraud Amount: {{fraud_amount}}

You are hereby commanded under Section 106 BNSS / Section 102 CrPC to IMMEDIATELY FREEZE / DEBIT-FREEZE the aforementioned account and preserve the current balance.

Furthermore, provide the complete account statement (CSV format) from {{start_date}} to {{end_date}} along with KYC documentation.

Authorizing Officer:
{{investigating_officer}}
{{police_station}}

To,
The Law Enforcement Compliance Manager
{{receiver_name}}

STATUTORY DEMAND FOR CYBER FORENSIC IP LOGS & USER METADATA

Under Section 94 BNSS and Section 79A of Information Technology Act, you are directed to urgently provide subscriber IP connection logs, port numbers, login/logout timestamps (UTC), and associated registration metadata for the target identifier: {{target_identifier}}.

Time Period: {{date_range}}
Reason: Investigation of Identity Theft / Cyber Impersonation in FIR No. {{case_number}}

Please send logs in structured CSV or JSON format within {{deadline}}.

Investigating Officer:
{{investigating_officer}}
{{police_station}}

To,
The Nodal Officer / LEA Response Cell
{{receiver_name}}

LEGAL REQUISITION FOR CALL DETAIL RECORDS (CDR) & SUBSCRIBER DATA

Pursuant to Section 94 BNSS, you are hereby ordered to furnish Call Detail Records (CDR), Cell ID location coordinates, IMEI logs, and SDR subscriber details for target mobile line: {{target_identifier}}.

Date Range Required: {{date_range}}
Case Reference: FIR No. {{case_number}}

Please reply with CSV attachment containing CallID, Timestamp, Caller, Receiver, Duration, CellID, IMEI.

Investigating Officer:
{{investigating_officer}}
{{police_station}}

To,
The Director / Corporate Legal Compliance Division
{{receiver_name}}

OFFICIAL REQUISITION FOR CORPORATE FINANCIAL RECORDS & PAYROLL LEDGERS

In connection with ongoing corporate fraud / payroll embezzlement investigation in FIR No. {{case_number}}, you are required to produce verified bank statement ledgers, vendor contracts, ROC registration details, and employee payroll distribution records for: {{company_name}}.

Period under Audit: {{date_range}}
Submission Deadline: {{deadline}}

Investigating Officer:
{{investigating_officer}}
{{police_station}}
